    <TD COLSPAN="2" STYLE="font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; text-align: right; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid">Three months ended</TD><TD STYLE="padding-bottom: 1pt; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: bottom">
