    <TD STYLE="padding-left: 10pt; text-align: left; width: 64%">1. Early-stage development activities</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 2%">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center; width: 16%"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Wingdings; font-size: 10pt"><B>l</B></FONT></TD>
