<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt">The following documents,
filed with the securities commissions or similar regulatory authorities in certain provinces of Canada and filed with, or furnished to,
the SEC are specifically incorporated by reference in, and form an integral part of, this prospectus:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 1in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

