<TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.5in"></TD><TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.5in">3.</TD><TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; padding-right: 0pt">the annual information
                                            form of the Company dated March 20, 2025 and filed on March 21, 2025 for the year ended December
                                            31, 2024 (the &ldquo;<B>Annual Information Form</B>&rdquo;);</TD></TR></TABLE>

